      "text": "interactions amongst plants."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.216083,
      "end": 24.455707000000004,
      "text": "The major zones in river ecosystems are"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.481708,
      "end": 26.591124999999998,
      "text": "determined by the river bed gradient or"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.617125,
      "end": 27.697874000000002,
      "text": "current velocity."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.044083,
      "end": 31.531083,
      "text": "The concept became popular in conservation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.830541,
      "end": 33.210791,
      "text": "and was deployed in a range of"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.236791,
